### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### Add a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Connect user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Get all contacts
